 ### Eggs and the Nest
 
 - Egg tokens on the Intruder board represent the Eggs in the Nest; taking or destroying Eggs removes them from the Intruder board. When no Eggs remain (all carried away or destroyed), the Nest is destroyed — mark it with 1 Injury marker.
-- **Destroying Eggs:** in a Room with uncarried Eggs, resolve a Shoot or Melee Attack against them — each Injury (of any type) destroys 1 Egg; Melee against Eggs never draws a Contamination card, whether it hits or misses, and a miss causes no Wound. Grenades may be thrown at Rooms with uncarried Eggs as if an Intruder were there: a Grenade destroys 2 Eggs, a Molotov Cocktail 1 Egg. **After every single attempt to destroy an Egg, perform a Noise roll.**
